<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-048" chapter-id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family" source-id="s-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family-ws1791560">
  <p id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family:p001:m0000" ref="258_ae3_26e_AAA">弘之</persName>高祖晉司徒<persName id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family:p001:m0007" ref="6x2_7cd_tw2">祗</persName>，後封靈州公，不欲封本縣，故<persName id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family:p001:m0022" ref="6x2_7cd_tw2">祗</persName>一門還復泥陽。曾祖<persName id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family:p001:m0032" ref="258_ae3_26e">暢</persName>，祕書丞，沒胡，生子<persName id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family:p001:m0043" ref="258_ae3_26e_A">洪</persName>，晉穆帝永和中，胡亂得還。<persName id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family:p001:m0057" ref="258_ae3_26e_A">洪</persName>生<persName id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family:p001:m0059" ref="258_ae3_26e_AA">韶</persName>，梁州刺史，散騎常侍。<persName id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family:p001:m0071" ref="258_ae3_26e_AA">韶</persName>生<persName id="c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi-zhao-family:p001:m0073" ref="258_ae3_26e_AAA">弘之</persName>。</p>
</text>
